# Vendored third-party files must stay byte-for-byte identical to their pinned upstream releases
# (hashes are recorded in each folder's README). Some bundles, such as Datastar, contain newlines
# inside template-literal strings, so core.autocrlf rewriting them to CRLF on checkout would change
# program behaviour, not just formatting.
src/WikiWikiWorld.Web/wwwroot/js/vendor/** -text
